  "text_md": "15/2/23, 9:34 Schréder Hyperion-Schréder EXEDRA-2023-02-14 10:42:45.885 +0000-CMS-TALQv2.5.0-update.1-CapabilityList **Description** Address of the Driver Type Serial number of the driver Name of the Project / Tender Version of the driver hardware firmware Installation date and time of driver Year of manufacture of the driver Week of manufacture of the driver. Warranty expiration date. It can be reset Application Type of the driver asset depending on the use case.\n\nThis entity contains the managed and tracked attributes of a specific controller\n\n## # Attribute\n\n driverTypeAddress  serial  projectID  firmwareVersion  installationTimestamp  manufactureYear  manufactureWeek  warrantyExpirationDate  applicationType\n\n## Controller Asset\n\n## Attributes\n\n## # Attribute\n\n controllerTypeAddress  serial  firmwareVersion  installationTimestamp  registrationTimestamp  projectID  controllerColor\n\n connectionType  warrantyExpirationDate  manufactureYear  manufactureWeek  applicationType\n\n## Description\n\nAddress of the Controller Type Serial number of the Controller Version of the controller hardware firmware Installation date and time of OLC Registration date and time of OLC Name of the Project / Tender Painting color of the controller expressed as a color system-color value, (e.g: RAL-7035) Type of the connection to the luminaire Warranty expiration date. It can be reset Year of manufacture of the controller Week of manufacture of the controller Application Type of the controller asset depending on the use case.\n\n# Services\n\nabout:blank 49/61\n",
